  "redeem": [
    "Launch DOORS on Roblox and wait in the lobby (you do not need to start a run).",
    "Open the Shop using the button on the left side of the lobby screen.",
    "Click the \"Enter code here\" box at the top of the Shop window and type or paste a code, including any spaces.",
    "Press the check mark button to claim the Knobs, Stardust or Revives."
  ],
  "notes": "DOORS is a co-op horror game from LSPLASH where you and up to three friends push through a haunted hotel one numbered door at a time. Each room can hide an entity like Rush, Ambush, Screech or Seek, and you survive by listening for sounds, hiding in closets, and grabbing keys, books and levers to open the way forward. Runs can go into the Mines, the Backdoor and other floors, and one wrong move sends you back to the lobby.\n\nMost DOORS codes give Knobs, the shop currency you spend on items and Revives before a run, plus a few that give Stardust. The 50 Knob LAZYDEVS code and the 33 Knob 3rd code are the best ones to grab first. LSPLASH usually drops new codes with big updates, visit milestones and collaborations, and the bigger ones that include a Revive tend to expire within a few weeks.",
