  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Do DOORS codes need spaces and capital letters?",
      "a": "Type codes like BIJUU MIKE and JUMP OVER THE BRICK with the spaces in them. Some players report capitals do not matter in DOORS, but copying the code exactly is the safest way to avoid an error."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why did the 777 code stop working in DOORS?",
      "a": "777 was a limited code that gave 777 Knobs, 7 Stardust and a Revive, and it has now expired along with older ones like SIX2025 and 5B. Big codes with a Revive usually only last a few weeks."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I get a free Revive in DOORS without a code?",
      "a": "Yes. The game page says joining the LSPLASH Roblox group gives you one free Revive, which is worth doing before a hard run like the Mines."
    }
  ],
